+# A page you were sent to is not where it was
+
+Twenty pages were moved out of the first reader's way, into `docs/retired/`. Each is a dated account of an earlier
+state of the programme, or a plan or a protocol that a later page replaces. Nothing was deleted, and no word in
+them was changed. The owner approved the move on 2026-11-12 (register row P-825).
+
+A page that cites one of them still names its old place. Find that place on the left.
+
+| where it was | where it is | what it is | what stands in its place now |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `AUDIT_REPORT.md` | `docs/retired/AUDIT_REPORT.md` | the consolidation audit of 2026-05-22; its own banner says historical | the pages its banner names |
+| `docs/RECONTEXT_AUDIT_AND_MASTERPLAN_2026-07.md` | `docs/retired/RECONTEXT_AUDIT_AND_MASTERPLAN_2026-07.md` | an audit and a plan of 2026-07-01; its banner says historical | `frontier/B1861_the_closure_programme/PROGRAMME.md` |
+| `docs/SESSION3_SYNTHESIS.md` | `docs/retired/SESSION3_SYNTHESIS.md` | a session's handoff; its banner says historical | nothing: a dated record |
+| `docs/RECOGNITION.md` | `docs/retired/RECOGNITION.md` | the recognition campaign registered 2026-07-03 | nothing: a dated campaign |
+| `docs/AUDIT_2026-07-05.md` | `docs/retired/AUDIT_2026-07-05.md` | a repository audit of that day | `docs/progress/REVIEWS.md`, for the reviews since |
+| `docs/CLOSURE_2026-07-11.md` | `docs/retired/CLOSURE_2026-07-11.md` | the two-seat closure verdict of July | `docs/CAMPAIGN_STATUS.md` |
+| `docs/CODEX_AUDIT_RESPONSE_2026-07-12.md` | `docs/retired/CODEX_AUDIT_RESPONSE_2026-07-12.md` | a response to an outside audit of the documents | nothing: a dated record |
+| `docs/CRYSTALLIZATION_2026-07-09.md` | `docs/retired/CRYSTALLIZATION_2026-07-09.md` | a seat's text with its landing status | nothing: a dated record |
+| `docs/REBASE_2026-07-12.md` | `docs/retired/REBASE_2026-07-12.md` | the consolidated state before one campaign | `docs/CAMPAIGN_STATUS.md` |
+| `docs/CLOSURE_PROGRAM.md` | `docs/retired/CLOSURE_PROGRAM.md` | a draft plan of 2026-07-23, with nearly the name of today's programme | `frontier/B1861_the_closure_programme/PROGRAMME.md` |
+| `docs/PHASE1_WRAP.md` | `docs/retired/PHASE1_WRAP.md` | the wrap of that plan's first phase | nothing: a dated record |
+| `docs/COMMS_PROTOCOL.md` | `docs/retired/COMMS_PROTOCOL.md` | the protocol of a room of seats that no longer exists (v1.2, 2026-08-06) | `docs/seats/README.md` |
+| `docs/ROADMAP_TOE.md` | `docs/retired/ROADMAP_TOE.md` | a roadmap; its own banner says superseded on 2026-08-08 | `docs/THE_FRAMEWORK.md`, by its banner |
+| `docs/THE_PATTERN_MEDITATION.md` | `docs/retired/THE_PATTERN_MEDITATION.md` | a meditation of 2026-08-12 | nothing: a dated record |
+| `docs/PARAMETER_CLOSURE_MASTERPLAN.md` | `docs/retired/PARAMETER_CLOSURE_MASTERPLAN.md` | a plan of 2026-08-29 | `frontier/B1861_the_closure_programme/PROGRAMME.md` |
+| `docs/PUBLICATION_CAMPAIGN.md` | `docs/retired/PUBLICATION_CAMPAIGN.md` | the campaign of 2026-08-30 for the paper | the paper's folder, frozen after its ninth draft |
+| `docs/THE_PATTERN_MEDITATION_2.md` | `docs/retired/THE_PATTERN_MEDITATION_2.md` | a meditation of 2026-08-13 | nothing: a dated record |
+| `docs/CLOSURE_2026-07-05.md` | `docs/retired/CLOSURE_2026-07-05.md` | an entry page of 2026-07-05 | `README.md` |
+| `docs/THE_ROLES_ACCOUNTING.md` | `docs/retired/THE_ROLES_ACCOUNTING.md` | a measurement of 2026-09-12 | nothing: a dated record |
+| `docs/SUBMISSION_CAMPAIGN.md` | `docs/retired/SUBMISSION_CAMPAIGN.md` | the campaign of 2026-08-31 to send the paper | the paper's folder, frozen after its ninth draft |
+
+*This page is the record of the move. One row of the front page leads here, and no other page was edited for it.
+A gate holds the table: each page it names is where the table says, every page in the folder has its row, and no
+old place is taken by a new file.*
